-## Fixture Management
-
-### Using Fixture Files
-
-```bash
-#!/usr/bin/env bats
-
-# Fixture directory: tests/fixtures/
-
-setup() {
-    FIXTURES_DIR="${BATS_TEST_DIRNAME}/fixtures"
-    WORK_DIR=$(mktemp -d)
-    export WORK_DIR
-}
-
-teardown() {
